<article class="app-prose app-prose--summary">
    <h2>A calm daily planner for iPhone, iPad, and Mac</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for highlight in app.highlights %}
        <li>{{ highlight }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p>
        concinnity works offline and keeps your planner on your device. Optional iCloud sync keeps your iPhone, iPad, and Mac up to date through your own private iCloud database, and you can turn it off at any time in the app’s settings.
    </p>
    <p>
        Calendar access is optional. With your permission, concinnity shows events from your calendars on its timeline, and it only creates or changes an event when you choose to.
    </p>
    <p>
        concinnity has no advertising, tracking, third-party analytics, or Curated Design server, and Curated Design cannot see your planner content. The <a href="/apps/concinnity/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains this in full.
    </p>
</article>
